        <font color="#000000" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> I'm always on the lookout for wis items, I'm currently on the prowl for one of those wis tomes--I'm approaching the point where I'll no longer use a weapon (that Sap of Piety was surgically grafted to my hand, so I'll have to have it removed) as my spells will do far more admirably.</P><P>I understand we're planning a Kaes raid? If not, can we do a mass impromptu raid again and go kill us some buncha monsters and get lots of exp? </P><P>Forget 35 and 40, 41 seems to be a hell level too, or is 40-45 another unmentioned hell level?</P><P>Merilla Vanilla Cleric 41<BR>Not just a young-in anymore!<BR>"Um--You gonna loot that?"</font></td>
