        <font color="#000000" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> I believe the Megadien is going to plan another kaesora raid.  So we can conceivably get the spirit tome from the tortured librarians, do we yet have a druid that can evac to EJ from DL? or do we have to go the long way :).  </P><P>have you given any thought to gettin gyour cleric quest, golden armor?</P><P><BR>as for 41-44 you should be breezing through those lvs.  Try not to group with anyone in their upper forties it would make the exp a lot slower ;).  Try to stay around a 2-3 lvl gap up to 44 and as minimal as 38 and chain pull till people scream STOP</P><P>Abyn<BR>Elementalist of the 52 Circle</P><P></P><P>Edited by - abyn on 02 Apr 2001  16:29:14<a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
